;Nagoya                 | ERTH-RJGG | Earth        | Sol         | Temp. Unavail.
;New York               | ERTH-KLGA | Earth        | Sol         | Temp. Unavail.
;Night City             | ERTH-KNCX | Earth        | Sol         | Temp. Unavail.
;Venus Orbital          | VORB      | Venus        | Sol         | Temp. Unavail.
;Nnamdi Azikiwe Station | OKLG      | 1036 Ganymed | Sol         | Temp. Unavail.
;Alta Hai               | VHAI-ALTA | Alta Hai     | Hevru Hai   | Temp. Unavail.
;Glaze                  | ADHB-GLA  | Glaze        | Aldhibain   | Temp. Unavail.
;Ring of Friendship     | QURU-R    | Ring of F... | Quaru       | Temp. Unavail.
